WEBVTT

00:00:25.461 --> 00:00:30.542
They collected over 1,600
existing ice cream flavors,

00:00:30.566 --> 00:00:36.088
and together, we fed them to an algorithm
to see what it would generate.

00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:39.865
And here are some of the flavors
that the AI came up with.

00:00:40.444 --> 00:00:41.915
[Pumpkin Trash Break]

00:00:41.939 --> 00:00:43.341
(Laughter)

00:00:43.365 --> 00:00:45.834
[Peanut Butter Slime]

00:00:46.822 --> 00:00:48.165
[Strawberry Cream Disease]

00:00:48.189 --> 00:00:50.315
(Laughter)

00:00:50.339 --> 00:00:54.936
These flavors are not delicious,
as we might have hoped they would be.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.824
So the question is: What happened?

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:58.242
What went wrong?

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:00.225
Is the AI trying to kill us?